#X text 240 83 Closes the PureData application. The exit can be triggered
by a bang or by the exit method \, optionally after a delay specified
by the @delay property. The exit code can be set with the @rc property
or with the exit method argument.;
#X text 240 168 Typical use cases:;
#X text 250 193 • Automated shutdown — closing PureData automatically
at the end of a scheduled performance \, installation or test run \,
for example when a timer reaches a certain value.;
#X text 250 263 • Controlled exit with a return code — exiting with
a specific exit code \, which is useful when Pd is called from a script
or a launcher that expects a return value.;
